@startuml SEQ_Gestion_Reservation
title CALENDRIA - Diagramme de Sequence\nUC8 & UC9 : Gestion des reservations (Dashboard)

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam roundCorner 6
skinparam sequenceMessageFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontSize 12

skinparam participant {
    BackgroundColor #FAFBFC
    BorderColor #2E86C1
    FontColor #2C3E50
}

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2E86C1
    LifeLineBorderColor #2E86C1
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #EBF5FB
    GroupBorderColor #E67E22
    GroupHeaderFontColor #E67E22
}

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────
' PARTICIPANTS
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────

actor "Restaurateur" as rest #D6EAF8
participant "React Dashboard" as view #FDEBD0
participant "Axios Interceptor" as axios #FDEBD0
participant "API Platform (Symfony)" as api #D5F5E3
participant "ReservationService" as service #D5F5E3
participant "NotificationService" as notif #D5F5E3
database "PostgreSQL" as db #D5F5E3

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────
' FLUX 1 : AFFICHAGE DU DASHBOARD
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────

== Phase 1 : Chargement des Donnees ==

rest -> view : Accede au Dashboard
activate view

view -> axios : GET /api/reservations?date=today
activate axios

axios -> axios : Injecter JWT Header\n(Authorization: Bearer <token>)

axios -> api : Requete HTTP GET
activate api

api -> api : JWT Validator (Check Signature)
api -> db : SELECT * FROM reservation\nJOIN client ON ...\nWHERE date = today
activate db
db --> api : Liste des reservations (JSON)
deactivate db

api --> axios : 200 OK
deactivate api

axios --> view : Data Collection
deactivate axios

view --> rest : Affiche la liste + Plan de salle dynamique

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────
' FLUX 2 : ACTION SUR UNE RÉSERVATION
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────

== Phase 2 : Action "No-Show" et Libération ==

rest -> view : Clique sur "Marquer No-Show"\n(Resa ID: 42)

view -> axios : PATCH /api/reservations/42\n{ "statut": "noshow" }
activate axios

axios -> api : Requete HTTP PATCH
activate api

api -> service : handleNoShow(42)
activate service

service -> db : UPDATE reservation SET statut = 'noshow'
service -> db : UPDATE table SET statut = 'disponible'
service -> db : UPDATE client SET taux_noshow = recalculated

service -> notif : sendStatusUpdate(clientId, 'noshow')
activate notif
notif -> notif : Appel externe Twilio API
notif --> service : SMS Envoyé
deactivate notif

service --> api : Success
deactivate service

api --> axios : 200 OK (Updated Object)
deactivate api

axios --> view : UI Update Event
deactivate axios

view --> rest : La table est liberee et l'UI rafraichie
deactivate view

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────
' LEGENDE
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────

legend bottom
  **Conceptscles :**
  1. Le token JWT est injecte par l'intercepteur a chaque requete.
  2. L'API est protegee (Stateless) : le serveur verifie le token avant d'acceder aux DB.
  3. Le changement de statut declenche des effets de bord complexes (SMS + MAJ BDD).
endlegend

@enduml
